{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgdXq6CbvDs65Dxz17LWk","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"To try Kimi K3.1 Pro on the day it launched, the article's author pointed the llm tool at Moonshot's API with a single command: llm openai endpoint, the Moonshot URL at api.moonshot.ai/v1, a stored key named kimi, the model name kimi-k3.1-pro, and an option setting reasoning_effort to low. The prompt asked for an SVG of a pelican riding a bicycle. The command was added to LLM 0.32 in August and can run prompts against any OpenAI-compatible endpoint, which is why a new model from a different provider needed no dedicated plugin.\n\nThe command does not log its results, so the author redirected output into two files. Standard output went to one and standard error to the other, and the article describes the standard error file as holding the reasoning trace. This keeps the generated SVG and the model's reasoning as separate artifacts for each run, which matters when the question is how reasoning effort changes the output.\n\nKimi K3.1 Pro supports three reasoning levels: low, medium and max. The author ran the pelican prompt at all three and then ran fresh pelicans against the previous model, Kimi K3, at the same three levels. Rerunning the older model, and not relying on earlier outputs, means both generations were prompted the same way under the same settings. The article shows the max-level pelican from K3.1 Pro, but the excerpt contains no description of how the images differ across levels or between the two models.\n\nThat limits what the test establishes. It is a side-by-side visual comparison of one prompt, and the article's evidence on quality comes from elsewhere: Artificial Analysis scored K3.1 Pro at 55, behind only Claude Opus 5.5 at 58, and Moonshot's own benchmarks put it roughly level with Opus 5.5 and GPT-6 Astra. The model is currently available only through Moonshot's API, with full weights promised by November 4, 2026."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1315,"cache_read_input_tokens":4790,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1315},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1ec212ea-5e83-4866-b5f5-5669c9cacf73","uuid":"a228baa1-ef6f-444e-ac7a-ec208508874f","timestamp":"2026-11-02T05:15:42.058Z","request_id":"req_011CgdXq5zwnstdYcMXzVzor"}
